From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Build tooling contributors <build-tools@example.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 13:33:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] test: validate terminal order within each invocation stream

Independent gRPC streams can arrive in either order. A global event
sequence can reject successful concurrent delivery even when each
invocation keeps its accepted results before its terminal event.

Retain stream identity in the recording fixture and check result
ordering within its owning invocation. Cover legal stream interleavings
while retaining loss, order, acknowledgement and queue-bound checks.
